{"unit_id":"Zhiyi-Zhao__dsh-schedule-send#card-zh","repo":"Zhiyi-Zhao/dsh-schedule-send","commit":"30c6ba7888a20a89bef0739b4a9e162e41207e1b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-schedule-send 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的定时发送插件。在会话输入框旁加入时钟控件，用户可选择快捷时间或本地日期时间，将纯文本草稿安排到当前会话稍后发送。Host 将任务持久化到本地队列，并在到期后把内容作为普通用户消息提交到原会话；会话中的状态卡片可取消尚未发送的任务。适合希望预先安排提示或消息、让 DSH 会话稍后继续处理的用户。应用需在发送时运行；无需额外账号或 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:694-723","index.js:360-469"]}
{"unit_id":"Zhiyi-Zhao__dsh-schedule-send#card-en","repo":"Zhiyi-Zhao/dsh-schedule-send","commit":"30c6ba7888a20a89bef0739b4a9e162e41207e1b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-schedule-send lets DSH Web users schedule plain-text messages from the composer clock control. Choose a preset or custom time, then cancel queued sends from the conversation card. The Host stores tasks locally and submits due messages as ordinary user messages. DSH must be running at send time.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:694-723","index.js:360-469"]}
