{"unit_id":"Zhiyi-Zhao__dsh-schedule-send#feature-composer","repo":"Zhiyi-Zhao/dsh-schedule-send","commit":"30c6ba7888a20a89bef0739b4a9e162e41207e1b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-schedule-send 的功能「安排会话消息」：把当前纯文本草稿加入指定发送时间，并送入当前会话。用户通过输入框旁的时钟控件选择快捷时间或自定义时间。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:428-455","client.js:478-500","index.js:423-436"]}
{"unit_id":"Zhiyi-Zhao__dsh-schedule-send#feature-cancel","repo":"Zhiyi-Zhao/dsh-schedule-send","commit":"30c6ba7888a20a89bef0739b4a9e162e41207e1b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-schedule-send 的功能「查看和取消任务」：会话消息卡片显示排队状态，并允许取消仍处于待发送状态的任务。用户在卡片上点击取消；已开始投递或已离队的任务不能撤回。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:709-716","index.js:439-462"]}
{"unit_id":"Zhiyi-Zhao__dsh-schedule-send#feature-delivery","repo":"Zhiyi-Zhao/dsh-schedule-send","commit":"30c6ba7888a20a89bef0739b4a9e162e41207e1b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-schedule-send 的功能「到期投递」：Host 定期检查本地队列，将到期内容作为普通用户消息提交到原会话。到期任务在应用下次启动后也会重新检查；失败时会重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:308-353","index.js:365-393"]}
{"unit_id":"Zhiyi-Zhao__dsh-schedule-send#caveat-runtime","repo":"Zhiyi-Zhao/dsh-schedule-send","commit":"30c6ba7888a20a89bef0739b4a9e162e41207e1b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-schedule-send 将排队消息保存在本地 $DSH_HOME/schedule-send/queue.json；未设置 DSH_HOME 时使用 ~/.dsh。到期投递依赖应用运行，关闭期间到期的任务会在下次启动后处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:45-50","index.js:381-393"]}
{"unit_id":"Zhiyi-Zhao__dsh-schedule-send#caveat-attachments","repo":"Zhiyi-Zhao/dsh-schedule-send","commit":"30c6ba7888a20a89bef0739b4a9e162e41207e1b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"定时发送只接受纯文本草稿；如果当前草稿含附件，浏览器端会禁用安排发送控件，因此需要先移除附件再安排消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:452-455"]}
